        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-427224"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL237516https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL237516at07%2FAug%2F2412%3A44PM%2Clasteditedby%E7%8E%8B%E6%8C%AFhttps%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F63dcc61a614cb4ba53000e3fat07%2FAug%2F2412%3A46PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-37516" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-37516</a> at 07/Aug/24 12:44 PM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/63dcc61a614cb4ba53000e3f" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">王振</a> at 07/Aug/24 12:46 PM</h5>

<p>1，节点触发高可用，策略存储隔离，撤离虚拟机</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320350" alt="1723005562224-20240807-043922.png" height="471" width="1266" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320351" alt="1723005588953-20240807-043948.png" height="438" width="1540" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>2，节点node-hagent报错rabbitmq：Too man heartbeats missed</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320352" alt="1723005634668-20240807-033702.png" height="703" width="1852" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>3，easystack-ha日志对应时间node-1网络心跳失败</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320353" alt="1723005761326-20240807-032924.png" height="747" width="1867" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>4，虚拟机有4个没有疏散走，2个一直为重建状态，需要看下是否可以重置</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320354" alt="1723005948330-20240807-044548.png" height="454" width="1504" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-427239"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:29953ef2-fede-4d69-9248-491afae9de72"
                id="word_commented_557058:29953ef2-fede-4d69-9248-491afae9de72"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A29953ef2-fede-4d69-9248-491afae9de72">
                    郇宏达
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">07/八月/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-427239"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd" class="user-hover" rel="5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd" data-account-id="5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd" accountid="5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd" rel="noreferrer">谢礼杰</a> 请分析如下2点：1）触发高可用的原因；2）那4个虚拟机没疏散走的原因，以及其中2个状态为重建，是否可以重置状态然后重启恢复（注意双实例风险）。</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-427269"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd"
                id="word_commented_5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd">
                    谢礼杰 (未活跃)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">07/八月/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-427269"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <blockquote><p>1）触发高可用的原因</p></blockquote>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320396" alt="image-20240807-074517.png" height="296" width="1428" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320391" alt="image-20240807-075900.png" height="450" width="1098" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>node-1节点在07:29分附近有大量container oom相关信息，node-agent进程卡住了半小时左右，所以心跳无法再上报。查看messages日志，发现日志断层，需要进一步调查。</p>



<blockquote><p>2）那4个虚拟机没疏散走的原因，以及其中2个状态为重建，是否可以重置状态然后重启恢复（注意双实例风险）</p></blockquote>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320400" alt="image-20240807-080655.png" height="261" width="863" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320401" alt="image-20240807-081943.png" height="225" width="1422" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>“三维资源调度服务器”云主机未触发撤离，原因是访问nova-api超时，nova-api并未收到该请求，所以虚拟机状态是active。</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320397" alt="image-20240807-081022.png" height="687" width="1414" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320395" alt="image-20240807-081441.png" height="504" width="1411" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>“视频监控“云主机撤离失败，原因是访问DB rpc超时，对于超融合节点，很容易触发pod疏散时mariadb、rabbitmq不可用等问题。其它服务如cinder，也都出现心跳上报问题。</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320394" alt="image-20240807-083338.png" height="379" width="950" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320399" alt="image-20240807-083410.png" height="443" width="958" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320390" alt="image-20240807-090044.png" height="706" width="1406" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320398" alt="image-20240807-090134.png" height="705" width="1410" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320393" alt="image-20240807-090341.png" height="173" width="1404" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320392" alt="image-20240807-090747.png" height="170" width="1397" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>重建的两台虚拟机都因为nova-scheduler调度超时导致撤离终止，超时的原因是连接rabbitmq异常，所以当前没有产生双实例。其中2个状态为重建，可以重置状态然后重启恢复。</p>
        </td></tr>
