        <tr id="comment-body-427447"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>日志里 两次 kernel oom，分别kill的是 Prometheus 和 beam， 多次 evicted 都是 gnocchi-metrics。 没看到 内存对 ha-agent的直接影响</p>

<p>但日志里发生kernel oom时，伴随大量 containerd 对不同contaienrID的 OOM Event 日志，不确定是否会对 节点其他container 产生影响。<a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-5200" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-5200</a> </p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-427454"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd"
                id="word_commented_5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5f051e43ce15e8002604dfcd">
                    谢礼杰 (未活跃)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">09/八月/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-427454"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>故障时间段内，nova-compute、nova-api、proton-server、cinder-volume均出现日志断层现象，nova-compute服务上报心跳耗时1598.76s</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320631" alt="image-20240809-032009.png" height="444" width="1447" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320630" alt="image-20240809-032100.png" height="314" width="1433" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/320632" alt="image-20240809-032241.png" height="531" width="1443" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-427477"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5e466aece7724a0e72629bbd"
                id="word_commented_5e466aece7724a0e72629bbd"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5e466aece7724a0e72629bbd">
                    杨阳
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">09/八月/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-427477"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>触发oom 会导致 containerd 和 containerd-shim 内存增加 ，详见  <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6062" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6062</a></p>

<p>因为 containerd 内存主要是因为  OOM Event 日志打印，而大量日志导致 containerd gc 频繁，其他 container 日志会阻塞，为什么container 日志会阻塞见 <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6647" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6647</a>  ，简单说是 containerd 中有协程在读取fifo(container 的标准输出) 到 kubele 指定的日志文件中</p>

<p>日志出现断层，说明容器进程可能正写日志，但因无法将日志写入容器标准输出导致进程阻塞，继而导致 nova-compute服务上报心跳超时</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-427478"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5e466aece7724a0e72629bbd"
                id="word_commented_5e466aece7724a0e72629bbd"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5e466aece7724a0e72629bbd">
                    杨阳
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">09/八月/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-427478"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>通过 <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6062" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6062</a> 中的复现文件，</p>

<p>在 6.3.1 环境中测试有以下日志，发生oom时只收集 oom 有关进程，上报oom的 container 也是对应pod</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>Aug 09 16:13:23 node-1.domain.tld kernel: Memory cgroup stats for /kubepods/pod663fe5d1-02cf-41d5-96f1-c721524e35c9:
...
Aug 09 16:13:39 node-1.domain.tld containerd[7445]: time="2024-08-09T16:13:39.036151057+08:00" level=info msg="TaskOOM event container_id:\"fdb2e8f3e5fcdea03c8f5676085cf259da081a3ce1c69efc69a08bfd39d4d366\""
