        <tr id="comment-body-428680"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>复现 yaml 文件内容，以下会持续 oom </p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: stress-ng
spec:
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: stress-ng
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: stress-ng
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: stress
        image: alexeiled/stress-ng:0.11.19-ubuntu
        command:
          - /bin/bash
          - -c
          - |
            stress-ng --vm 1 --vm-bytes 1G --timeout 120s &amp;
            wait
            echo "start to sleep"
            sleep 1d
        resources:
          requests:
            memory: "128Mi"
            cpu: "500m"
          limits:
            memory: "128Mi"
            cpu: "500m"</pre>
</div></div>
        </td></tr>
